{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04788","headline":"伯奴边见归田赋因投赵侍御 · 张说","name":"伯奴边见归田赋因投赵侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尔家叹穷鸟，吾族赋归田。\n莫道荣枯异，同嗟世网牵。\n黄陵浮汨渚，青草会湘川。\n去国逾三岁，兹山老二年。\n寒鴞鸣舍下，昏虎卧篱前。\n客泪堪斑竹，离亭欲赠荃。\n放言久无次，触兴感成篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}